### 👤 AUTH – CURRENT USER
################################################

### GET AUTHENTICATED USER
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### TEST INVALID TOKEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.123
Accept: application/json

